  <config><![CDATA[{
  "game_id": 74,
  "created_at": "2026-04-01T21:40:32.000Z",
  "level_num": "custom",
  "user_id": 22366,
  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "### Fix the Reset Button\r\n\r\nTry filtering by a category, then clicking Reset. What happens? What should happen?\r\n\r\n`originalProducts` holds the full list and is never changed. Figure out why the reset button isn't restoring it, and fix it. All your changes go inside the `resetBtn` event listener.\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Need help? Ask AI for help.</summary>\r\n\r\n**Example Prompts:**\r\n- \"How do I change the value of a dropdown menu using JavaScript?\"\r\n- \"How do I write a loop to copy items from one array to another?\"\r\n- \"What is the syntax for adding an item to an array?\"\r\n- \"Why do I need to clear the current list before copying the data back?\"\r\n\r\n</details>",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "split",
    "ai_tutor_mode": "engineer",
    "predict_settings": {
      "isPredictLevel": false,
      "solution": "",
      "questionType": "freeResponse",
      "placeholderText": "",
      "multipleChoiceOptions": [
